<title>POLAND: POLISH ENERGOAPARATURA TO START TRADE ON AUG 20.</title>
<headline>POLISH ENERGOAPARATURA TO START TRADE ON AUG 20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish engineering firm Energoaparatura SA will start trading on the Warsaw bourse's third or free market, which trades in less liquid and small companies, on August 20, a bourse deputy head said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The bourse's board decided to start trade in 1,813,860 Energoaparatura SA shares on the free market on August 20,&quot; Wlodzimierz Magiera told a news conference.</p>
<p>Currently the third market is empty.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
